{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lycoris</strong> blends anime-inspired characters with realistic environments to deliver a fast-paced and stylish zombie-survival experience. Battle through escalating waves, unlock new characters, and upgrade your abilities as the challenge intensifies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2714 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Wave-Based Action Combat</strong><br>Survive nonstop zombie attacks that grow stronger, faster, and deadlier with each wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Survival-Focused Game Modes</strong><br>Push your limits by reaching the highest wave possible or test your skills in more competitive solo challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Character Selection</strong><br>Choose from multiple anime-style characters\u2014each with unique traits that change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Realistic Environments</strong><br>Fight through detailed maps with dynamic lighting and atmospheric tension that contrasts with the game\u2019s anime characters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342190?t=1772668710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/3333feef4cdae7b8e7203f65185d8685118e8487/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772668710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/e096ff004ee7829b3764b423625c3a11ff961a53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772668710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/e096ff004ee7829b3764b423625c3a11ff961a53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772668710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Sp